{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much does this thing weigh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2320,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Well, try to pick it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4040,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7980,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9220,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Be nice to it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10440,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-105 lbs\n-105 lbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11720,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-It consists of four motors connected up to these spinning magnet arrays"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17380,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you spin these fast enough it will actually levitate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21140,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-That's correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23080,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Let's see if we can do it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25440,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ready?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25940,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's fire it up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32880,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-It's lifting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35360,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Okay, it's flying now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36540,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37280,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yeah, definitely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43200,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Now it is so easy to just move around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47160,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48700,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Give it a push. Like, it's got some real-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51260,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53120,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can carry some weight, eh?\n-Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56480,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-That is amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60840,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how does it work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62480,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it's similar to how a magnet falling through a pipe is slowed down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65880,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anytime a conductor experiences a changing magnetic field"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69620,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "electric currents are induced in it which create a magnetic field to oppose that change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74320,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in this case the spinning magnets induce currents in the copper sheet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78020,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They create a magnetic field which is nearly a mirror image of the spinning magnets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82480,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so they're repelled."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84080,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the rotors spin fast enough, this repulsion leads to levitation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88720,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90660,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Let's shut it down now\n-Yep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92660,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-It's just gonna come"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94660,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gently land."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98160,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-The induced currents then encounter resistance in the copper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101220,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they dissipate their energy as heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103520,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105560,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this copper is pretty hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107940,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's gotten warmer. Yeah, I can still keep my hand on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110200,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At least for a second or two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111480,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But it is like a hot mug of coffee or something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115460,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I experienced this before with another electromagnetic levitation device."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119120,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except with this one the changing magnetic field was created by an electromagnet in the base"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123660,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inducing currents in a light aluminum plate which levitated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127020,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whoa!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128480,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The plate got so hot you could boil water on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131320,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Check how hot this plate is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133720,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have two north magnets facing each other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137480,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they normally just kinda like fall off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139560,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140100,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there a similar problem here or not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142440,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Not really. No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143500,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason is: the magnetic fields that are induced by currents in the copper sheet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148820,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are a mirror image of the applied magnetic fields."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152040,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the effect is so quick that as it moves it just kind of follows it around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157960,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Making this device work in practice is harder than it looks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161060,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For one thing the magnetic field of the permanent magnets has to be very strong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165060,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Neodymium magnets are strong, but there's a special configuration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168400,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can use to make them even stronger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170920,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's called a Halbach array."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172480,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're used in particle accelerators."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174060,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're used in fridge magnets, actually -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176840,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Halbach arrays, so they're stronger on the side that sticks to the fridge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179620,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they use less material, overall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181580,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Magnetic field lines run from north to south."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184040,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're normally symmetric on both sides of a magnet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you rearrange them like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188760,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the magnetic field lines are channeled almost entirely into one side of the magnetic array."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194260,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they cancel out on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196760,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This configuration produces a much stronger magnetic field,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199580,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without changing the properties of the magnets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201900,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In these rotors there are 12 wedge-shaped magnets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The magnetic poles are fixed in this particular arrangement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207890,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This increases the magnetic field on the bottom side and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210260,
    "dDurationMs": 2152,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost eliminates it on the top."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212420,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the magnets spin they create a rotating magnetic field in the copper beneath them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216640,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This induces currents that create magnetic fields"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219460,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which oppose the magnetic field of the spinning magnets above."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222980,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The result is a repulsive force that is effectively lift for this quadcopter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227980,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in addition to lift there is also drag."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231120,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Energy is clearly being dissipated in the system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233300,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the heat produced by the induced currents and the copper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236280,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That energy comes from the fact that magnetic of the induced current"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239940,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is not a perfect mirror of the spinning magnets above."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242980,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead the induced magnetic poles are slightly ahead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246700,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they produce a backward force on the rotors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249220,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is really a backwards torque"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251360,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why the rotors on alternate corners have to spin in opposite directions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255680,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because otherwise they would produce a net spin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258060,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and turn the whole machine in one direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260680,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This way they cancel out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262560,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This principle has been used to achieve levitation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264640,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in everything from Maglev trains to hover boards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267840,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's being considered as a means to make the Hyperloop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270800,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A super fast system for transporting people and goods"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through tubes at very low pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275640,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But instead of spinning the magnets, the vehicles motion itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279280,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would cause the magnetic field to change in the conductive track below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283220,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in the future you think this is gonna be how we travel?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285900,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think ongoing developments in digital motor controllers and very powerful magnets"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291480,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will mean that talking about moving humans and cargo at extremely high speeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is actually something that we can as a species kind of look at,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298880,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and be like: wow!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300540,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It turns out that getting from one city to another city in the same day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303840,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is something that the next billion or two billion people might have the option to do in one lifetime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311840,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312640,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Veritasium is supported by viewers like you on Patreon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315820,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by Audible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317140,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Audible has an unmatched selection of audiobooks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320060,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plus original shows, news, comedy and more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323480,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for viewers of this channel they offer a free 30-day trial of their service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327440,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just go to audible.com/veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329800,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you're looking for a good book recommendation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331960,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe you can try the one I'm listening to right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334500,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is \"Elon Musk: Tesla, SpaceX and the Quest for a Fantastic Future\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338920,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by Ashlee Vance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340080,
    "dDurationMs": 6500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a biography about one of the - in my view - most impressive entrepreneurs alive today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346580,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This book was written by interviewing hundreds of his employees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351000,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his acquaintances and Elon Musk himself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353160,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it provides a really in-depth and thorough look at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356640,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that incredible determination that's made possible all of Elon Musk's ventures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361340,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you're intrigued by him and his work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363720,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you should check out this book."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365360,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can download it for free by going to audible.com/veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368750,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or you can pick any other book of your choosing for a one month free trial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372350,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to thank audible for supporting me and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374550,
    "dDurationMs": 6530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to thank you for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
